eath toll from the high-speed collision near Urda, Toledo, to 69, down from 74 reported earlier. Fifteen people remain in intensive care, and three days of national mourning began Thursday.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/death-toll-from-spain-train-crash-rises-to-74-as-royals-visit-victims","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n2","cat":"World","title":"Israel election: Netanyahu bloc leads but falls short of majority","summary":"Netanyahu's bloc won 53 of 120 Knesset seats and the opposition camp 48, leaving Arab parties, with a record 19 seats, holding the balance. President Herzog will now consult parties before assigning someone to try to form a government.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/netanyahu-bloc-emerges-ahead-in-israeli-election-but-fails-to-secure-majority","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n3","cat":"Business","title":"Alphabet plunges 12.6% as tech drags Wall Street lower","summary":"The Dow fell 0.25% to 52,342.56, the S&P 500 lost 0.30% to 7,720.39 and the Nasdaq dropped 1.37% to 26,184.72 on Thursday. Alphabet's revenue miss revived worries about AI spending.","source":"Reuters via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/wall-street-slides-alphabet-revenue-184007636.html","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Major","title":"Binance hit by $6.3B hack, the largest crypto theft on record","summary":"Binance put the losses at about $6.3 billion, with roughly $3 billion frozen on-chain so far. TRM Labs linked the attack to North Korea-associated hackers, and deposits and withdrawals were temporarily suspended.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/crypto-platform-binance-confirms-major-hack-with-more-than-25bn-frozen","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n5","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney hosts EU leaders in Montreal to deepen Canada-EU ties","summary":"Prime Minister Mark Carney is hosting European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen for talks on closer cooperation in trade, technology, clean energy and critical minerals. Leaders meet Friday; some EU states object to the term 'associate membership.'","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12125614/canada-eu-summit-montreal/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n6","cat":"World","title":"Russian drone strike on Dnipro railway station kills at least 14","summary":"A Russian drone hit a station platform in Dnipro where commuter and passenger trains were standing, killing at least 14 and injuring at least 10. Ukraine, the U.S. and Russia are set to hold trilateral talks in November.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/at-least-13-killed-several-injured-in-russian-drone-strike-on-ukrainian-railway-station","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n7","cat":"AI","title":"Ottawa to invest up to $1.6B in Canadian AI firm Cohere","summary":"The federal government will fund Cohere in stages alongside Nvidia, Bell and Schwarz Group. Cohere commits to at least 1,000 Canadian technical jobs and $1.7 billion in computing infrastructure by 2030.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12126174/ottawa-ai-investment-cohere/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n8","cat":"Business","title":"Amazon misses Q3 estimates; shares slide","summary":"Amazon reported revenue of $201.9 billion and EPS of $1.89, both slightly below forecasts, and gave Q4 guidance under expectations. AWS grew 39% to about $46 billion; shares fell roughly 4-7% in early trading.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/live/amazon-earnings-live-q3-earnings-miss-sends-stock-lower-203345870.html","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Major","title":"Patrick Stewart, star of Star Trek and X-Men, dies at 86","summary":"The British actor, known as Captain Jean-Luc Picard and Professor Charles Xavier, died at his Los Angeles home after Alzheimer's disease and Lewy body dementia. He was knighted in 2010.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/patrick-stewart-star-of-star-trek-and-x-men-dies-aged-86","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n10","cat":"Business","title":"ECB holds rates at 2.5%; Lagarde to leave early in February","summary":"The European Central Bank kept its deposit rate at 2.5% with eurozone inflation at 3.8%. President Christine Lagarde will step down on Feb. 7, 2027, about nine months before her term ends.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/ecb-holds-rates-at-25-as-lagarde-announces-early-exit-with-inflation-near-double-the-targe","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n11","cat":"World","title":"Vance reportedly writes to Iranian official to revive talks","summary":"The Wall Street Journal reported that Vice President JD Vance contacted Iran's security council head to restart negotiations, while Gulf states were warned of possible new U.S. strikes after the Nov. 3 midterms. Trump disputed the account.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/jd-vance-contacts-senior-iranian-official-in-bid-to-revive-peace-talks","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n12","cat":"Canada","title":"Auditor general finds 'critical gaps' in military ammunition","summary":"Auditor General Karen Hogan said rebuilding the Canadian Armed Forces' ammunition stockpile will take several years, despite $9.2 billion committed over 13 years in 2024. The defence minister accepted all six recommendations.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12126362/auditor-general-report-ammunitions-denfence/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n13","cat":"AI","title":"Mistral releases open weights for trillion-parameter model","summary":"Mistral Large 4 is a trillion-parameter model whose weights are available on Hugging Face. The French company is aiming it at cyber defence and agentic coding.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/mistral-releases-weights-for-its-trillion-parameter-ai-model-targeting-cybersecurity/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Business","title":"U.S. economy grew 3.4% in Q3, beating forecasts","summary":"The advance estimate showed GDP growth speeding up from a revised 2.2% in Q2, driven by business investment, government spending and steady consumers. September PCE inflation rose to 3.6% year over year.","source":"USA Today via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/articles/us-gdp-growth-accelerated-third-131135158.html","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n15","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney warns Cleveland-Cliffs over Stelco layoffs","summary":"About 175 Stelco workers have been laid off and a memo says that could reach 500. Carney said the owner would be making a mistake to ignore its acquisition commitments, and Minister Joly demanded workers be recalled.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12125929/mark-carney-stelco-layoffs-mistake/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n16","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI-backed Thrive Holdings to buy ADT in $15.3B deal","summary":"Thrive Holdings will pay $10 a share, about $7.6 billion in equity, for the home security company, which it plans to revamp with AI. OpenAI is a partner and investor in Thrive Holdings.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/openai-backed-thrive-holdings-acquires-adt/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"Jassy says AWS could become a $1 trillion business","summary":"Amazon expects about $220 billion in capital spending in 2026, mostly for AWS, and more in 2027. Andy Jassy forecast AWS growth above 40% in 2027 and 2028.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/aws-will-be-a-1t-business-jassy-says-but-first-it-will-spend-big/","published":"2026-10-29"},{"id":"n18","cat":"Canada","title":"Alberta referendum drew 70.4% turnout; most voted to stay","summary":"Official results show about three-quarters of voters rejected holding a binding separation referendum. Turnout was the highest for a provincewide vote since at least 1975, and voters backed pursuing immigration changes.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12126325/alberta-referendum-final-results/","published":"2026-10-29"}]}